%% kit migration flow — six steps + hold-state for unpublished kit
%% v1 — 2026-05-01

flowchart LR
  A[flat kit imports<br/>hop.top/kit/&lt;area&gt;] --> B[1. audit<br/>xray + grep]
  B --> C[2. rewrite imports<br/>sed per package]
  C --> D[3. replace directive<br/>local kit + hdl]
  D --> E[4. go mod tidy<br/>transitives]
  E --> F[5. fix API drift<br/>--verbose / xdg / etc.]
  F --> G[6. smoke + tests]
  G --> H{kit tag<br/>published?}
  H -- no --> I[hold replace<br/>local-only build<br/>PR draft]
  H -- yes --> J[drop replace<br/>pin version<br/>undraft PR]
  I --> H
